# Netlify edge rules. No build step — Netlify reads this file directly.
#
# The repo root IS the publish directory, so every committed file is served.
# The portal's source files are version-controlled but must never be fetchable:
# schema.sql maps out the tables and the RLS policies, which is a gift to anyone
# probing the portal. Block them at the edge — robots.txt only asks politely.
/portal/*.sql   /   404
/portal/*.sh    /   404
/portal/test/*  /   404
/portal/README.md   /   404
